rl-trino
========

This image is based on Trino 483 with 0 RunningLake patches.

Upstream components, unmodified:

  Trino server 483              Apache-2.0                       Trino Software Foundation
  Eclipse Temurin JRE 25.0.1+8  GPL-2.0 with Classpath Exception Eclipse Adoptium
  Red Hat UBI 9 minimal         Red Hat UBI EULA                 Red Hat

Trino is a project of the Trino Software Foundation, not of the Apache Software
Foundation. Of the 55 plugins the Trino 483 server distribution ships, this image keeps
five — iceberg, jmx, memory, opa, tpcds — and removes the rest; nothing inside a kept
plugin is modified. Each upstream component's own NOTICE and LICENSE files are shipped
where upstream placed them.

RunningLake content: the default configuration under /etc/trino and this file.
